lang=en-US> 3.8</span><span lang=zh-CN>flash</span><span lang=en-US> high</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-12T21:01:40.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{131}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Noto Sans SC Black';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{135}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[绿灯骤然亮起。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{138}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[旁边那台粉色86后轮狂暴地空转起来。胎面疯狂卷起冰冷的泥水，狠狠砸在奥德赛的车窗玻璃上。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:46:22.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{140}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Noto Sans SC Black';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:46:22.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{143}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[零下两度的湿滑路面，根本吃不住大油门起步，86的车尾猛地向右甩动。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{146}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[侯天一极其稳准地压下踏板三分之一。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:46:25.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{148}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Noto Sans SC Black';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:46:25.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{151}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[奥德赛的车头下沉，前驱车的重量压紧前轮，平稳地咬住地面，顺畅地向前滑出。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{154}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[车载音响里的重低音在车厢里炸开。快节奏的电子合成乐瞬间填满了狭小的空间。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{156}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[侯广智的后背重重贴在椅背上。他双手死死护着那杯冰美式，吸管里的黑色液体随着车身晃动剧烈起伏，硬是一滴都没洒出来。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{158}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[“卧槽！哥你慢点！”]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{160}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[后视镜里，粉色86还在路口中央剧烈扭动。车主手忙脚乱地反打方向盘修正姿态，那阵刺耳的轮胎尖叫被奥德赛远远甩在了车尾后面。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{162}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[侯天一单手搭在方向盘上方，掌心感受着路面传来的细碎震颤。变速箱平顺地拉高转速，机舱传来沉闷而连续的运转声。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{164}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[前方五百米，是一个接近九十度的右转路口。沥青路面泛着深黑色的湿光，边缘还堆着环卫车刚铲开的冰棱。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{166}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[后方终于炸响了一阵狂暴的排气声。86好不容易稳住了车身，仗着大马力在直道上疯狂缩短距离，车尾扬起大片浑浊的水雾。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{168}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[侯天一在入弯前三十米松开油门，右脚轻点刹车。防抱死系统的脉冲微弱地顶着鞋底，车速稳稳降到安全区间。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{170}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[方向盘顺畅地切入。奥德赛庞大的车身在湿滑的弯道上划出一道规整的弧线，四条普通的四季胎死死压在干燥的沥青行车线上。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{172}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[粉色86带着尖锐的刹车声冲了过来。后驱车入弯速度太快，冰冷的半热熔胎在弯心压到了结冰的白线，整台车瞬间推头，横着朝外侧绿化带滑过去。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{174}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[伴随一声凄厉的擦碰声，86在距离马路牙子只有几公分的地方勉强停下，车轮陷进路边的泥雪里，当场熄了火。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{176}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[侯天一顺手回正方向盘，奥德赛平稳驶入空旷的主干道。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{178}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[侯广智这才长长吐出一口气，手心里全是黏腻的冷汗。他低头看了看怀里完好无损的咖啡，又转头看了看身旁单手开车的堂哥。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{180}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[“哥，你刚才……真他妈像拓海。”]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{182}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[侯天一伸手把暖风往上拨了一档，顺势夺过小智手里的冰美式，咬住吸管吸了一大口。]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:29.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{184}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Google Sans Text';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[“大冷天套半热熔跑街，神仙来了也得原地打转。”]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-11T18:44:33.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T18:34:49.000Z" objectID="{F140526A-0EDB-4EA8-B64A-1F6223971B9D}{186}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Noto Sans SC Black';font-size:18.0pt;&#xA;color:#201F1E"><one:T><![CDATA[]]